Fast Rust-based bundler for JavaScript with Rollup-compatible API

Rolldown is primarily designed to serve as the underlying bundler
in Vite, with the goal to replace esbuild and Rollup with one unified
build tool. Although designed for Vite, Rolldown is also fully
capable of being used as a standalone, general-purpose bundler. It
can serve as a drop-in replacement for Rollup in most cases, and
can also be used as an esbuild alternative when better chunking
control is needed.
